# Audition — configuration
#
#   cp .env.example .env      then fill in whatever you actually have.
#
# NOTHING HERE IS REQUIRED. With an empty .env, Audition runs end to end:
# local copy-on-write forks, the offline conformance-test generator, and a
# template verdict. Keys only add the Kimi and Daytona tiers on top.
#
# .env is gitignored. Never commit real keys.
# A real environment variable always beats this file, so you can override any
# line for a single run:  KIMI_MODEL=kimi-k2-0905-preview ./audition run ...

# --- Kimi (Moonshot) -------------------------------------------------------
# Generates the conformance suite from your sentence, and writes the closing
# sentence. Without it, the offline generator is used instead.
# Get one at https://platform.moonshot.ai/console/api-keys
KIMI_API_KEY=

# Optional. Use api.moonshot.cn for the mainland-China endpoint.
# KIMI_MODEL=kimi-k2-turbo-preview
# KIMI_BASE_URL=https://api.moonshot.ai/v1

# --- Daytona ---------------------------------------------------------------
# Only needed for `--provider daytona`. Also requires: pip install daytona
# Get one at https://app.daytona.io  (Dashboard -> Keys)
DAYTONA_API_KEY=

# Optional. Set these only if your dashboard shows a non-default region/URL.
# DAYTONA_TARGET=eu
# DAYTONA_API_URL=https://app.daytona.io/api
